    {
      "id": "sec_s3l10_r1",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Arabic zaban mein do (two) cheezon ya afraad par dalalat karne ke liye lafz ke aakhir mein \"ـَانِ\" (Alif aur Noon Maqsoor) ka izafa kiya jata hai, jaise \"الْمُؤْمِنُ\" (ek momin) se \"الْمُؤْمِنَانِ\" (do momin). Mandarja zail Qur'ani alfaaz ka tarjuma samajhiye:",
        "content": "Arabic zaban mein do (two) cheezon ya afraad par dalalat karne ke liye lafz ke aakhir mein \"ـَانِ\" (Alif aur Noon Maqsoor) ka izafa kiya jata hai, jaise \"الْمُؤْمِنُ\" (ek momin) se \"الْمُؤْمِنَانِ\" (do momin). Mandarja zail Qur'ani alfaaz ka tarjuma samajhiye:",
